# Dev: leave empty. Vite proxies /api to the API on :4000, so cookies stay same-origin.
# Same-site production (Vercel rewrite to the API, see apps/web/vercel.json): leave empty.
# Cross-site production (web and API on unrelated domains): set to the API origin, e.g. https://api.example.com
#   and set COOKIE_SAMESITE=none + CLIENT_URL=<web origin> on the API. Also widen connect-src in vercel.json's CSP.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
